<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 Thesalonika</book>
  <para style="h">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Silvana leh Timothea chuan Thesalonika khuaa Pathian kan Pa leh kan Lalpa Isua Krista kohhran chibai kan bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pa Pathian leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Unaute u, nangmahni avângin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu hril fo tûr kan ni a, chu chu kan tih âwm rêng a ni. Rinnaah in ṭhang chak êm êm a, in zaa in inhmangaih tawnna pawh a thûk tial tial bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tihduhdahna leh hrehawm tinrêng chhel taka in tuara, rinnaa in nghehzia leh in chhelzia te hi kohhranhote zîngah kan chhuang ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ram avânga tuar in ni a, chuta lût tlâk in nih theih nân Pathian rorêl dikzia tihlanna in nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian chuan dik takin thil a ti ṭhîn a, tihrehawmtu che u chu hrehawmnain a thungrûl ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Isua chu vân aṭanga ama vântirhkoh thiltithei takte nên meialh zînga a lo lan hunah, nangni hrehawm tuarte hi a rawn chawlhtîr ang che u, keini pawh min chawlhtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian hre lote leh kan Lalpa Isua Krista Chanchin Ṭha ring duh lote chungah phuba a la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûngte chu Lalpa hma ata leh a thiltihtheihna ropui tak lak ata kumkhaw chhiatnaah chuan paih an ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mi thianghlim, amah ringtute hnên aṭanga ropuina leh chawimawina dawng tûra a lo kal nî chuan hrem an ni ang. In hnêna kan thu hril in lo rin avângin nangni erawh chu chûng ringtute zîngah chuan in tel ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian Pathianin a kohna che u phua in awm theihna tûr leh, ṭhat in duhna zawng zawng leh rinna avânga in thiltihte chu, a chaknaa a tihfamkimsak theihna tûr che uin, bâng lovin kan ṭawngṭaisak ṭhîn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, kan Pathian leh Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna zârah, kan Lalpa Isua hming chu in zîngah chawimawi a ni ang a, nangni pawh ama zârah chawimawi in ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, kan Lalpa Isua Krista lo kal lehna leh a hnêna kan inkhâwmna tûr thu-ah chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlarauva sawi emaw, thu hril emaw, kan lehkha ni âwm emaw ṭanchhana “Lalpa Nî chu a thleng reng tawh,” tih thu thang avânga in rilru tinghîng leh tibuai lo tûrin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu man eng kawng mahin hruai bo che u suh se. Pathian laka helna chu a lo thlena, Dânbawhchhepa, Boraltûra chu a lo lan zet hma chuan chu Nî chu a lo thleng dâwn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan miten pathiana an neih, an biak apiangte chu dovin an aia ropuiah a indah ang a, Pathian Tempul meuhva ṭhuin Pathianah a inchhâl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In hnêna kan awm lai khân chûng thu chu kan hrilh ṭhin che u kha in hre reng lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hun taka a lo lan theihna tûrin tûnah engin nge dâl rih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dân bawhchhiatna chuan tûnah pawh a rûkin a thawk mêk a ni; nimahsela, a dâltu chu lâk bo a nih hma chuan a lo lang mai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Dânbawhchhepa chu a lo lang ang a; mahse, ani chu Lalpa Isuan a rawn tihlum ang a, a lo kal lehna ropui takah chuan a rawn tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dânbawhchhepa chu Setana chakna nên a lo kal ang a, thiltihtheihna tinrêngin thil mak leh chhinchhiahna lem a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng boral tûrte chu dik lo takin kawng tinrênga bum an ni ang a, anmahni chhandam thei tûr Chanchin Ṭha thutak chu an lawm loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, dâwt an rin theihna tûrin Pathianin an zîngah bumna hri a lêntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thutak ring lova dik lohna lâwm zâwkte zawng zawngin thiam loh an chang vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unau, Lalpa duh takte u, nangmahni avângin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu hril fo tûr rêng kan ni; Thlarauva tihthianghlimin, thutak ring tûr leh rah hmasa atân chhandam tûrin Pathianin a thlang che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi atân chuan kan Lalpa Isua Krista ropuina chang ve tûrin kan Chanchin Ṭha hril hmangin a ko che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, unaute u, ding nghet ula, kan thuhrilah leh lehkhathawna kan zirtîr ṭhin kan thu hlan chhâwn che u kha pawm tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, kan Lalpa Isua Krista ngei leh Pathian kan Pa, min hmangaihtu, a khawngaihna avânga kumkhaw thlamuanna leh beiseina ṭha min petu chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />in rilru thlamuan sela, thil ṭha tinrêng in tih leh in sawiah tichak zêl che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan, unaute u, min ṭawngṭaisak rawh u. Lalpa thu chu in zîngah ropui tak leh chak taka a darh ang khân a darh zêl theihna tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mi dik lo leh mi sualte laka kan him theihna tûrin. Mi zawng zawngin an la ring si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chu a rinawm a, ani chuan a tichak che uin mi sual lakah chuan a vêng him ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thu kan pêk che u angin in ti a, in tih zêl pawh Lalpaah chuan kan ring tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan in thinlungte chu Pathian hmangaihna hre lehzual tûr leh Krista anga dawhtheihna nei tûrin kaihruai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Unaute u, kan hnên aṭanga zirtîrna an dawn anga awm lo unau, dâwngdah taka awm zawng zawng laka inthiarfihlîm tûrin kan Lalpa Isua Krista hmingin thu kan pe a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmahni ngeiin kan tih dân zir tûr in nih in hria a, in zîngah dâwngdah takin kan awm ngai loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu chaw mah a thlâwnin kan ei ngai lo va, in zînga mi tu mah kan tihhautak lohna tûr che uin chhûn leh zân hah tak leh rim takin hna kan thawk ṭhîn a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In mi châwm kan phût theih loh vâng a ni lo va, in mi entawn atân tiin kan thawk zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In hnêna kan awm lai khân, “Hna thawk peih lo tawh phawt chuan ei pawh ei suh se,” tiin kan hrilh ṭhin che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zînga ṭhenkhat an dâwngdah a, mahni hna thawk si lovin mi hnaa inrawlh an chîng tih kan lo hria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang mite chu thawk mawlh mawlha mahni thawh chhuah ring tûrin Lalpa Isua Krista hminga thu pein kan fuih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute u, nangni zawngin thil ṭha tih ning suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu pawhin he lehkhathawna kan thu sawi hi an zawm duh loh chuan chhinchhiah bîk ula, kawm serh rawh u, an zah theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hmêlma ang chuan ngai lo ula, unau angin zilh zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Remna Lalpa ngei chuan kumkhuain kawng tinrêngah remna pe che u sela, Lalpa chu in zaa hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei Paulan keima kut ngeia chibai ka bûkna che u a nih hi. Hetianga ka ziak hi ka lehkhathawn apiang chhinchhiahna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna in zaa hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
